@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml

title Feature-free PDG information-flow evidence

rectangle "Immutable typed CPG\nPDG + exact SDG summaries + CFG sites" as CPG #DBE4FF
rectangle "Stable dense influence projection\ndata · summary · control rows" as Projection #E5DBFF
rectangle "SecurityLabels\nHigh · Low · declassifier cuts" as Labels #FFF3BF
rectangle "Product BFS\n<latex>(v,b),\;b\in\{0,1\}</latex>" as Product #D3F9D8
rectangle "FlowViolation\nexplicit + implicit shortest witnesses" as Flow #FCC2D7
rectangle "Secret node set" as Secrets #FFF3BF
rectangle "Simple BFS + timing-site table\nconditional CFG edges · IndexAccess" as Timing #C3FAE8
rectangle "LeakSite\nbranch target / index + shortest witness" as Leaks #FCC2D7
rectangle "Caller review\nrepresented evidence · advisory verdict" as Review #FFE8CC

CPG -[#7048E8,bold]-> Projection : borrow + canonicalize
Labels -[#F08C00,bold]-> Product : starts · sinks · cuts
Projection -[#2F9E44,bold]-> Product : product transitions
Product -[#C2255C,bold]-> Flow : classify + reconstruct
Secrets -[#F08C00,bold]-> Timing : starts
Projection -[#0CA678,bold]-> Timing : influence reachability
CPG -[#4C6EF5,bold]-> Timing : branch/index sites
Timing -[#C2255C,bold]-> Leaks : enumerate every mechanism
Flow -[#E8590C,bold]-> Review
Leaks -[#E8590C,bold]-> Review

note bottom of Projection
  Sorted NodeId rows · deduplicated dependence edges
  Explicit heap queues and parent arrays
  Native call depth independent of graph depth
end note

note bottom of Review
  Empty means no path in represented evidence
  It is not a source- or machine-level security proof
end note

legend bottom
  | Color | Meaning |
  |<#DBE4FF>| represented CPG evidence |
  |<#E5DBFF>| PDG/SDG influence projection |
  |<#FFF3BF>| caller policy |
  |<#D3F9D8>| confidentiality search |
  |<#C3FAE8>| timing search |
  |<#FCC2D7>| advisory finding |
  |<#FFE8CC>| caller-owned interpretation |
endlegend

@enduml
